## Output Format

Generate the prompt as plain text. First line is the positive prompt,
second line starts with "NEGATIVE:" followed by the negative prompt.

Example:
A professional office environment with modern desks and computers, warm natural lighting through large windows, clean minimalist interior design, soft depth of field, high quality, detailed, 8K
NEGATIVE: blurry, low quality, watermark, text, distorted, ugly, dark, grainy
